# armour/shared/pauldron_winged3_r: the medium WINGED pauldron on the right shoulder (winged.3; FORGE-SHOULDERS, STYLE_P2 28.3).
# one upswept point like an eave: the top edge dips and the outer end sweeps up in a curve into a single point
# (Jade, Sun Temple, Starspire); the sweep lit along its upper edge.
# Rides the lean and the bob and lifts a pixel on wind-ups (`up`). Finish regions: R the eave's lit upper edge, G the point, N the seam under the eave, P the plate.
# Shared by the man and the woman (D10). Generated by FORGE-SHOULDERS gen.py from shapes.py (re-run, never hand-edit
# the derived views). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
role pauldron winged.3
layer armNear
anchor shoulderR
keys pauld
z 5
side R

